  {
   "sq": "Si ishte udhëtimi?",
   "en": "How was the trip?"
  },
  {
   "sq": "I mrekullueshëm! Saranda është vendi im i preferuar tani.",
   "en": "Wonderful! Sarandë is my favourite place now."
  },
  {
   "sq": "Dhe hoteli?",
   "en": "And the hotel?"
  },
  {
   "sq": "Mesatar. Dhoma ishte e vogël, por pamja ishte e shkëlqyer.",
   "en": "Average. The room was small, but the view was excellent."
  },
  {
   "sq": "Dhe ushqimi?",
   "en": "And the food?"
  },
  {
   "sq": "Perfekt! Peshku ishte më i miri që kam ngrënë.",
   "en": "Perfect! The fish was the best I have eaten."
